  "Two degrees off level": "Dos grados fuera de nivel",
  "ARCHIVIST PENN": "ARCHIVISTA PENN",
  "Everything in its place": "Cada cosa en su sitio",
  "Through to the admin wing": "Pasa al ala administrativa",
  "Ride the service lift up to the Neon Market": "Sube en el montacargas de servicio al Mercado Neón",
  "Take your ticket stub": "Recoge tu resguardo",
  "Talk to Old Fare at the ticket booth (E)": "Habla con Viejo Pasaje en la taquilla (E)",
  "Deal with the Conductor's fare-dodgers (J)": "Encárgate de los colados del Revisor (J)",
  "Take your ticket stub past the stacks": "Recoge tu resguardo pasadas las pilas",
  "Send a Rift Bolt through the bars into the lock (U)": "Lanza un Proyectil de grieta entre los barrotes hasta el candado (U)",
  "Defeat the Conductor": "Derrota al Revisor",
  "Ride the freight lift up to the Neon Market": "Sube en el montacargas hasta el Mercado Neón",
  "Peel off the freight tape": "Quítate la cinta de embalaje",
  "Unhook the chain on your cage (E)": "Desengancha la cadena de tu jaula (E)",
  "Fight off the dock crew (J)": "Rechaza a la cuadrilla del muelle (J)",
  "Peel the freight tape off your arms": "Quítate la cinta de embalaje de los brazos",
  "Punch the lock through the bars with a Long Jab (U)": "Golpea el candado entre los barrotes con un Directo largo (U)",
  "Defeat Dockmaster Graft": "Derrota al Jefe de muelle Graft",
  "Take the lift past the last car up to the Neon Market": "Toma el elevador pasado el último vagón hasta el Mercado Neón",
  "flooded rail bed": "vía inundada",
  "Untie the peace-knot": "Desata el nudo de paz",
  "Talk to Granny Hone (E)": "Habla con la Abuela Hone (E)",
  "Beat the Whetstone's students (J)": "Vence a los alumnos del Esmeril (J)",
  "Untie the peace-knot on your sword": "Desata el nudo de paz de tu espada",
  "Cut the whole line of rats with one Draw (U)": "Corta toda la fila de ratas con un solo Desenvaine (U)",
  "Defeat the Whetstone": "Derrota al Esmeril",
  "Take the goods lift behind the stage up to the Neon Market": "Toma el montacargas tras el escenario hasta el Mercado Neón",
