  "The Hunter is down. Halcyon calls off the hunt: Heat cleared.": "El Cazador ha caído. Halcyon cancela la cacería: Alerta borrada.",
  "A Syndicate safe house: your Heat is cleared.": "Un piso franco del Sindicato: tu Alerta se ha borrado.",
  "Halcyon does not deal with you. Keep your Heat down.": "Halcyon no negocia contigo. Mantén baja tu Alerta.",
  "The Ledger does not deal with you yet. Meet them after dark at the Baron's old wreck.": "El Libro aún no negocia contigo. Reúnete con ellos de noche en el viejo pecio del Barón.",
